      <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 1rem;">Operations Head</p>
      <p style="font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--charcoal-soft); line-height: 1.6;">Sunita ensures smooth operations, from inventory management to timely deliveries.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: center; padding: 2rem; background: var(--cream); border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid var(--border);">
      <div style="width: 80px; height: 80px; background: var(--gold-light); border-radius: 50%; margin: 0 auto 1rem; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-weight: 600; color: var(--gold); font-size: 1.5rem;">AK</div>
      <h3 style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--charcoal);">Amit Kumar</h3>
      <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 1rem;">Logistics Manager</p>
      <p style="font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--charcoal-soft); line-height: 1.6;">Amit coordinates all deliveries and setups, ensuring everything arrives on time and perfectly arranged.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

